# unit-watch-spike.vrs: unit-watch step 1, the spike (D19). Which game signal says "a unit of ours hit a player, or a
# player hit it" (deal, taken, apply or health, NyarDevTools .devfight), what each costs a tick, whether a purge's
# staged despawn raises any of them, and what the walk check reads at our units on open ground and under the ground
# (.devstrand, .devground). Evidence only: the verdict is read from the log copy afterwards, so most checks are
# expect-log on the dev tools' own lines.
#
# Needs: NyarDevTools (with .devfight/.devstrand/.devground) and DevChatEcho; Chaos invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable
# true`, a Boolean, never false); marks pond (ground y about 0, so 30 m under stays above the walk check's -100) and
# ravine; Debug.TimingLog on in the dev cfg.
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\] x=(?P<PX>-?[0-9.]+) y=(?P<PY>-?[0-9.]+) z=(?P<PZ>-?[0-9.]+)
# (a) six spiders beside an invulnerable Chaos: they attack him (by=npc hit=player); Chaos swings back (by=player)
chat .devfight 75 40
expect-log \[DEV FIGHT\] start seconds=75
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Spider_Forest 6
expect-reply spawned 6 CHAR_Spider_Forest
wait 20
cast lmb 60 0
wait 1
cast lmb -60 0
wait 1
cast lmb 0 60
wait 1
cast lmb 0 -60
wait 1
cast lmb 60 0
wait 1
cast lmb -60 0
wait 1
cast lmb 0 60
wait 1
cast lmb 0 -60
wait 10
shot full spike-fight
expect-log \[DEV FIGHT\] done deal=(?P<DEAL>[0-9]+) taken=(?P<TAKEN>[0-9]+) apply=(?P<APPLY>[0-9]+) health=(?P<HEALTH>[0-9]+) timeout=60
# (c) the walk check at the spiders on open ground, then (d) one sunk 30 m under the pond's ground
chat .devground
expect-log \[DEV GROUND\] .* ground=(?P<G0>[a-z:A-Z]+)
chat .devstrand -581295882 under 30
expect-log \[DEV STRAND\] moved=1 how=under .* ground=(?P<G1>[a-z:A-Z]+)
wait 12
chat .nyar debug here 40
shot full spike-strand
# (b) the purge's staged despawn: no fight signal and no kill credit while the units go
chat .devfight 40 60
expect-log \[DEV FIGHT\] start seconds=40
chat .nyar purge
wait 2
chat .nyar purge confirm
expect-log purged: timeout=20
expect-log \[DEV FIGHT\] done deal=(?P<PDEAL>[0-9]+) taken=(?P<PTAKEN>[0-9]+) apply=(?P<PAPPLY>[0-9]+) health=(?P<PHEALTH>[0-9]+) timeout=60
expect-calc ${PDEAL} + ${PTAKEN} + ${PAPPLY} + ${PHEALTH} == 0
# (c) the ravine: twenty spiders on rough ground, the walk check at the mark
chat .devgo ravine
expect-log \[DEV TP\] ravine
wait 4
chat .devground
expect-log \[DEV GROUND\] .* ground=(?P<G2>[a-z:A-Z]+)
chat .nyar purge
wait 2
chat .nyar purge confirm
wait 5
console TPHome
wait 3
